Z||000000||85ZainoGT||12-02-2001||12:05 PM||||I want to put mine back on, when I bought the car it was off and the seller said the check engine light comes on every once in a while because its off, so id like to put it back on, jus incase the light comes on for another reason  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> lol...  anyways... can someone tell me how to install this or whatever?   whereand what I need to have/do.. thanks!<P>------------------<BR>Paul Ventimiglia<BR>1987 GT all the options :)<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpicNEW2b.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||avengador1||12-02-2001||01:06 PM||||The Fiero store has the egr tubes with gaskets. The tube connects to the upper manifold and the egr valve on the cross over tube. It probably is easier to connect the tube to the upper manifold if you take the manifold off. It takes a little wrangling to get the screws to line up with the gaskets on the egr valve itself.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
